c8f44c49d9","name":"Foul Breath","type":"feature","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Once per encounter, as a primary action, ghouls can make an attack roll (d20+16) against the Fort Defence of all living creatures within a 4 square cone. If successful, targets become poisoned by death fog.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"6ea150a6143fcda5","name":"Gnaw","type":"feature","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever a ghoul pins a target, it may make a free bite attack that ignores non-magickal DR.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"5ce689147f5a320e","name":"Poison","type":"feature","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"category":"Special Ability","description":"Whenever a ghoul’s bite deals damage to a living creature, there is a 50% chance (50 or less on d%) that the target becomes poisoned with death fog.","automation":{"kind":"adversaryAbility"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"8d4c39a55a286c40","name":"Pin","type":"technick","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-rough-white-teal.webp","system":{"description":"A successful grapple pins the target until your next turn. It becomes prone and flat-footed and can take only one minor action on its next turn; you are also prone and flat-footed while maintaining the pin.","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"0468506a2f890467","name":"Skill Focus (stealth, unarmed)","type":"technick","img":"icons/magic/nature/stealth-hide-eyes-green.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a trained skill and gain +5 to its checks. Each additional copy must apply to a different trained skill.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"trainedSkill"},"effects":{"se